            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This dataset represents a weighted average of the amount of recovered materials of four recycling facilities in Europe. The benefits for recovery of waste glass are modelled based on information from Held and Ilg (2011) and KBOB LCI data DQRv2:2016. It is assumed that 90% of the glass and 100% of the metals are recovered.;
